@startuml Chatly_Sequence_Handle_Friend_Request
title Chatly - Handle Friend Request (Simple)

autonumber
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
skinparam responseMessageBelowArrow true

actor "Authenticated User" as U
participant "Client" as Client
participant "ContactController\n/api/contacts/*" as ContactController
participant "ContactService" as ContactService
participant "ContactRepository" as ContactRepo
participant "GlobalExceptionHandler" as ExceptionHandler

U -> Client: Choose Accept / Reject / Block
Client -> ContactController: request(contactRecordId, action)
ContactController -> ContactService: handleRequest(contactRecordId, action)

alt Contact not found or unauthorized
  ContactService -> ExceptionHandler: AppException(...)
  ExceptionHandler --> Client: HTTP 4xx\nApiResponse{error}
else Success
  ContactService -> ContactRepo: save or delete contact record
  ContactRepo --> ContactService: updated
  ContactService --> ContactController: ContactResponse or message
  ContactController --> Client: HTTP 200\nApiResponse{code:1000, result/message}
end

Client --> U: Show updated status

@enduml